<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling tended weaker against the dollar on Tuesday at a commercial mean rate of 590.3073 compared to 590.1885 on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling rose marginally to 919.5527 compared to 921.1388 on Monday.</p>
<p>Commercial dealers said they expected a stable shilling against hard currencies in the short-term.</p>
</text>
